# grid-secrets waivers for this repo. One entry per line; a bare string matches
# any path containing it, and `path:type` matches exactly that finding on that
# file — prefer the exact form so a future .env.* is still caught.

# .env.testing is committed on purpose and holds no secrets: an APP_KEY for a
# throwaway test database, array cache/queue/session drivers, and BCRYPT_ROUNDS.
# It exists because `artisan --env=testing` falls back to .env without it, which
# once dropped the local dev database (see the note in phpunit.xml). The file
# says all of this at the top.
.env.testing:tracked-sensitive-file
